{# description: Statusmail zu einem Auftrag #}
{# variables: recipient_name, order_id, status, positions, delivery_date, sender_name, language #}
{% if language == "en" %}
Dear {{ recipient_name }},

Regarding your order {{ order_id }}:

Current status: **{{ status }}**
{% if delivery_date %}Expected delivery: **{{ delivery_date }}**{% endif %}

{% if positions %}
Order positions:
{% for pos in positions %}
- {{ pos.article }}: {{ pos.quantity }} {{ pos.unit }} – {{ pos.status }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

Best regards,
{{ sender_name }}
{% else %}
Sehr geehrte/r {{ recipient_name }},

bezüglich Ihres Auftrags {{ order_id }}:

Aktueller Status: **{{ status }}**
{% if delivery_date %}Voraussichtlicher Liefertermin: **{{ delivery_date }}**{% endif %}

{% if positions %}
Auftragspositionen:
{% for pos in positions %}
- {{ pos.article }}: {{ pos.quantity }} {{ pos.unit }} – {{ pos.status }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

Mit freundlichen Grüßen,
{{ sender_name }}
{% endif %}
